# Google AdSense Auto ads (optional). Copy to `.env` and fill in from https://adsense.google.com
# Publisher ID from AdSense (ca-pub-… or pub-…). Enable Auto ads under Ads → By site.
# Use the exact ID from AdSense (ca-pub-…); pub-… in .env is normalized to ca-pub-… at build time.
VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID=